<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 300 mln of 5-yr bonds April 17.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 300 mln of 5-yr bonds April 17.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry said it was offering 300 million zlotys worth of 12-percent five-year bonds at a tender for institutional investors on April 12.</p>
<p>The value date is May 5, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
